<title>USA: TRW Inc Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>TRW Inc Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Primary oper shr$0.93		    $0.76</p>
<p> Primary net shr 0.93		     0.87</p>
<p> Dil oper shr    0.92		     0.76</p>
<p> Dil net shr     0.92		     0.86</p>
<p> Net		 119,200		  117,000</p>
<p> Sales	     2,659,600		2,513,800</p>
<p> Primary avg shrs128,400		  134,200</p>
<p> Dil avg shrs    129,400		  135,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First quarter 1996 earnings from continuing operations included an $11.8 million benefit from insurance claim settlement and $12.6 million noncash charge related to adoption of FASB No. 121.</p>
<p>Net earnings in 1997 were $119.2 million compared to $117.0 million in 1996, which included $14.3 million of earnings from discontinued operations.</p>
</text>
